Z||000002||87ECO5||03-14-2000||08:17 AM||||Don't know of a club specific to your area.  However, there are several guys "around" you that have begun to schedule regular events.<P><B>BOILERMAKER</B> and <B>Monkeyman</B> are both from your neck of the woods.  Those two and guys like <B>2M4 Dale</B>, <B>BENGAL4</B>, <B>ChadMan</B>, <B>Eric</B>, <B>fiero56</B>, <B>Tabasco</B>, <B>william_thorniii</B> and myself (all from Ohio) try to hook up periodically to do stuff like breakfasts, lunches, cookouts, cruises, etc.<P>In fact, several of the guys I listed are getting together for a cookout early next month.  And, in late-June, most of us are hooking up for a big car show at the Mid-Ohio race course in Lexington, Ohio.<P>Welcome aboard.  You'll really enjoy this place!<P>BTW, what kind of Fiero do you have?||||reg||1
