Z||000012||ChadMan||03-21-2000||04:08 PM||||This might be a bad idea, because we'd have to get up pretty darn early...but if you want to do an Indy event, maybe we could cruise to the Speedway for Indy 500 practice (May 13 or 14), Pole Day (May 20) or Bubble Day (May 21).<P>In years past (before The Split), this would have been simply impossible because of the size of the crowd.  But I went to Pole Day in 1998 and was able to park across the street from the Speedway at 9:30 am!<P>Crowds may be bigger this year with the return of Al Jr. though.<P>When we're done, we can all go to Boilermaker's place, park in his yard, drink all his beer and eat every crumb of food in his house!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
